{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46959","headline":"寄匡阜诸公二首 二 · 齐己","name":"寄匡阜诸公二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峰前林下东西寺，地角天涯来往僧。\n泉月净流闲世界，杉松深锁尽香灯。\n争无大士重修社，合有诸贤更服膺。\n曾寄邻房挂缾锡，雨闻岩溜解春冰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46959.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46959","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}